{"id":"zeebrugge","name":"Zeebrugge","qid":"Q184383","country":"Belgium","locality":"Bruges","lat":"51.330833333","lon":"3.2075","built":"1899","year":1899,"year_text":"1899","century":"19th century","era":"19th century","period":"","date_basis":"Wikidata, earliest written record","style":"","heritage":"","type":"village","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zeebrugge","text":"Zeebrugge (Dutch pronunciation: [zeːˈbrʏɣə] ; from Brugge aan zee [ˌbrʏɣə ʔaːn ˈzeː], meaning \"Bruges-on-Sea\"; French: Zeebruges, pronounced [zebʁyʒ]) is a village on the coast of Belgium and a subdivision of Bruges, for which it is the modern port. Zeebrugge serves as both the international port of Bruges-Zeebrugge and a seafront resort with hotels, cafés, a marina and a beach.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zeebrugge","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[],"depictions":[{"id":"battlefield-1--bf1-zeebrugge","game":"battlefield-1","name":"BF1 Zeebrugge","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-pb54faba8cc5","w":1400,"h":591,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1_Zeebrugge_Map.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by MaZe D4rK on 2018-01-31"}}]},{"id":"battlefield-1--zeebrugge","game":"battlefield-1","name":"Zeebrugge","verified":false,"text":"Standard Zeebrugge Zeebrugge is a map featured in the Battlefield 1: Turning Tides North Sea expansion. It is set during the Zeebrugge Raid of the 23rd April 1918, an operation intended to deny German access to the English Channel by blocking the Bruges-Zeebrugge canal entrance with three obsolete ships. A landing on the Zeebrugge mole was made by a battalion of Royal Marines to support the mission.","text_source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/Zeebrugge","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-27b532ce954b","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Zeebrugge_03.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by FluoxetinePatch on 2018-03-31"}},{"id":"gh-4da8e1f4fb79","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Zeebrugge_04.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by FluoxetinePatch on 2018-03-31"}},{"id":"gh-63ca4aac1fad","w":1280,"h":720,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Turning_Tides_Concept.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Lamicrosz on 2017-10-10"}},{"id":"gh-8a1b40fd06a9","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Zeebrugge_01.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by FluoxetinePatch on 2018-03-31"}},{"id":"gh-bbaca6d769a9","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1_Turning_Tides_Zeebrugge.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Medlone on 2017-10-18"}},{"id":"gh-e55776142acc","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Zeebrugge_06.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by FluoxetinePatch on 2018-03-31"}},{"id":"gh-p960737cb294","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Zeebrugge_02.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by FluoxetinePatch on 2018-03-31"}},{"id":"gh-pcc68cdd5610","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Zeebrugge_05.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fan